---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About ctfpawned"
  description="Ethics and scope for ctfpawned."
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>
        ctfpawned is a teaching tool. Every vulnerable target runs inside this
        site, and every solution must explain the production fix.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p>
      The project deliberately avoids accounts, tracking, live third-party
      targets, and backend flag validation so it stays linkable and safe to run.
    </p>
    <article class="content-panel">
      <h2>Scope</h2>
      <p>
        The targets are toy applications made for this site. Use the techniques
        here only on systems you own or have written permission to test.
      </p>
      <p>
        Flags are checked locally in the browser. ctfpawned is built for
        learning and discussion, not for competitive scoring or secrecy.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
